  (descr "WeAct Studio STM32G474 core board V1.0, QFN48 (STM32G474CEU6) variant. 36.28 x 28.14 mm, two 2x12 2.54 mm headers, USB-C on the left edge, 4-pin SWD header at the right edge. Pads 1-24 are schematic connector P1 (VCC side), 25-48 are P2 (3V3 side); P1 odd pads outer row, P2 odd pads inner row.")
